{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_02",
  "title": "Jungle Detox Stew",
  "storyCode": "DT-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e67fbcbe0010d256d0386e0a48667815ea072d6e1bb8203f26fba184db243d58",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hurry up, Laios."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at this mushroom! Even the dungeon's walking mushrooms don't grow this big!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wouldn't it be amazing to see a walking mushroom this size...? Thoughts on having it for lunch later?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Careful now. The Gourmet Guide says jungle mushrooms are basically all poisonous to some extent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For example, they might give you full body rashes, thicken your blood, or make you throw up nonstop until every organ is down on the floor..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I'd rather not think about what the guide's author must have been through to learn all that in such detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The orcs only taught me how to identify <i>dungeon</i> mushrooms, so we'd best leave these alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But there are some animals that eat them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Still no. If only one or two critters consider it edible, it means it's probably toxic to everything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In other words, if we see lots of animals eating this, then it's likely to be edible for us, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Low roar)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Piercing buzzing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's something flying towards us! Careful, everyone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios's Party",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "WAAAAAAHHHH!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Knocks here and there)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha! Now that was an impressive explosion!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A good thing the test site was empty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Chamber pressure, off the charts. Same goes for temperature readings, and load capacity too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seems like it'll need reinforcement to perform well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Next, final adjustments to the previous configuration, loosen the belt, tighten the screws, and... done!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My newest masterpiece, the 'Invincible Cool Thing' will be fully operational. As long as I don't run into another accident!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, I should get rid of all these explosives first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Safety first! Avoid open flames..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Knocks here and there)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*cough* *cough* That thing over there keeps blowing up...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*cough* *cough*...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You alright, Marcille?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I-I'm fine! Just a little dizzy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Low roar)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's more...! Careful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A golem? Maybe a gargoyle?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Taste my magic—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "BOOM—!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "High Priest, High Priest? You there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...What was that?\n—Wagh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A crocodile?! Or a beast-man with a crocodile head?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? What's a beast-man?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He can speak too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why wouldn't I be able to? Hey, you there, Durins, did you crawl up from the underground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Durins'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is he talking about us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "See any other short ones around here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you saying me and Chilchuck look like the same race to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't you guys have 'Half-foot' here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...What are you talking about? Is something wrong with you all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right, have you seen our High Priest here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "High Priest?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Old guy, shorter than me, wears glasses."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's he doing in such a dangerous place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dunno. He thinks in mysterious ways."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, we haven't run into any old men."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He also moves in mysterious ways."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guess I should just give up and get back to the tribe, then. Like all the times I went out and looked for him before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Goodbye, strange tourists!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait! Could I ask if you've heard of Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh. Lucky for you, but also unlucky. Because I feel like I have, but also not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's someone else in the tribe who I'm sure knows where this Whatever Island is though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But that person happens to be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That High Priest you're looking for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bingo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How's this? Come back with me. We hardly ever find him when we go looking, but he always comes back sooner or later."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So basically, you guys were on an island with a huge dungeon, and somehow ended up here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More or less. Do you know anything about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uh... What's an island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? It's... a landmass completely surrounded by sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's a sea?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um... a large body of water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean a lake? You really like to use strange words."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, is it because we're inland right now and you haven't heard of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's because your questions are so strange! I've never heard of a sea, an island, or a Merini Village. Were you swept here from the other side of Terra by someone's tail or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Terra'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's what we're standing on right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Marcille tries to read the crocodile man's face for any sign he was pranking her.\nUnfortunately, the only message she gets from his eyes is 'Am I talking to a fool?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So in short, the one who calls the shots in this tribe of crocodiles—er, Archosauria—is the High Priest. The one Marcille blew up earlier was his..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "His mech."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The 'Invincible Cool Thing.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But if we blew up his 'mech'... would he still be willing to help us find Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's fine. It would've exploded with or without you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Always manages to blow up somehow."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The High Priest is a friendly man. I'm sure he won't blame you if you just explain everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's also a righteous man. He wouldn't leave a group of lost visitors stranded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's our High Priest!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Still, we should come up with a way to make amends."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry about it—wait, what's that good smell? Who's cooking today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Durin with the huge beard."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Terra, Acahualla, living paintings, the dungeon..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh... I can't wrap my head around it all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can use magic here, so at the very least some of the laws of reality are shared..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Falin... I bet I'd be as excited as Laios if you were here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sigh* I miss our days back at the academy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
